[/list]

[h2]Changelog[/h2]

[h3]1.4.0[/h3]
[list]
[*]Recycler queue is persistent across reloads.
[*]Scavenger no longer ignores a claimed pool.
[*]Defensive order respects the guard radius.
[/list]

[h3]1.3.2[/h3]
[list]
[*]Fixed a route loop when two pools share one node.
[*]Service truck aura no longer stacks twice.
[/list]

[h3]1.3.0[/h3]
[list]
[*]Command slot 6 became autonomous.
[*]Added the forced move order.
[*]Added the repair aura.
[/list]

[h2]Known Issues[/h2]

[list]
[*]A recycler built during a reload keeps the old queue.
[*]The scavenger may report a full load one cycle late.
[*]Long table cells wrap differently at very small font sizes.
[/list]

