[h2]Appendix B - Route Notes[/h2]

Route one starts at the northern extractor, crosses the crater rim and ends at
the central recycler. Route two mirrors it. Route three is a single long leg
with two forced stops, which is why it is the only route that respects a
defensive order mid-move.

The pool at the crater rim is the only one that never depletes. It is also the
only one guarded by two hostile patrols, so a scavenger without an escort will
lose the load before it arrives.

